lg:flex\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a class=\"group relative py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-bottom-0.5 after:h-px after:origin-left after:bg-forest-700 after:transition-transform after:duration-300 text-stone-600 after:scale-x-0 hover:text-forest-800 hover:after:scale-x-100\" href=\"/rooms\">Rooms</a><a class=\"group relative py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-bottom-0.5 after:h-px after:origin-left after:bg-forest-700 after:transition-transform after:duration-300 text-stone-600 after:scale-x-0 hover:text-forest-800 hover:after:scale-x-100\" href=\"/restaurant\">Restaurant</a><a class=\"group relative py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-bottom-0.5 after:h-px after:origin-left after:bg-forest-700 after:transition-transform after:duration-300 text-stone-600 after:scale-x-0 hover:text-forest-800 hover:after:scale-x-100\" href=\"/tours\">Experiences</a><a class=\"group relative py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-bottom-0.5 after:h-px after:origin-left after:bg-forest-700 after:transition-transform after:duration-300 text-stone-600 after:scale-x-0 hover:text-forest-800 hover:after:scale-x-100\" href=\"/story\">Our story</a><a class=\"group relative py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-bottom-0.5 after:h-px after:origin-left after:bg-forest-700 after:transition-transform after:duration-300 text-stone-600 after:scale-x-0 hover:text-forest-800 hover:after:scale-x-100\" href=\"/location\">Contact</a></nav><div class=\"flex items-center justify-self-end gap-2\"><div tabindex=\"0\"><a class=\"btn-primary hidden !px-5 !py-3 sm:flex\" href=\"/rooms\">Book a stay <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div><button class=\"icon-control grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-forest-950/15 text-forest-950 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-forest-700 hover:bg-forest-700 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-4 focus-visible:ring-forest-600/15 lg:hidden\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main><section class=\"border-b border-white/10 bg-forest-950 text-white\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[90rem] px-5 py-20 lg:px-10 lg:py-28\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#d49a75]\">Frequently asked questions</p><h1 class=\"mt-5 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.045em] sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl\">A few things to know before you arrive.</h1><p class=\"mt-7 max-w-2xl text-[17px] font-normal leading-8 text-forest-100/70\">Practical details about rooms, payment, food, location and exploring Sauraha.</p></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[90rem] gap-14 px-5 py-20 lg:grid-cols-[.65fr_1.35fr] lg:px-10 lg:py-28\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#a75536]\">Still wondering?</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.035em] text-forest-950\">We’re happy to help.</h2><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500\">Send us a message if your question is not covered here.</p><a class=\"mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-forest-700 pb-1 text-sm font-semibold text-forest-800\" href=\"/location\">Contact us <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"divide-y divide-stone-300 border-y border-stone-300\"><details class=\"group py-6\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.015em] text-stone-900\"><span>How do I book a room?</span><span class=\"text-2xl font-normal leading-none text-[#a75536] transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"max-w-2xl pr-10 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500\">Choose a room type, select your dates and submit a reservation request. We will confirm availability with you.</p></details><details class=\"group py-6\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.015em] text-stone-900\"><span>Do you accept online payment?</span><span class=\"text-2xl font-normal leading-none text-[#a75536] transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"max-w-2xl pr-10 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500\">No. Payment is made onsite.</p></details><details class=\"group py-6\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.015em] text-stone-900\"><span>What are the restaurant hours?</span><span class=\"text-2xl font-normal leading-none text-[#a75536] transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"max-w-2xl pr-10 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500\">The restaurant is open daily from 8:00 AM to 10:00 PM.</p></details><details class=\"group py-6\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.015em] text-stone-900\"><span>How far is the Rapti River?</span><span class=\"text-2xl font-normal leading-none text-[#a75536] transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"max-w-2xl pr-10 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500\">The property is approximately a 10-minute walk from the Rapti River and sunset viewpoints.</p></details><details class=\"group py-6\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.015em] text-stone-900\"><span>Can you arrange family or group accommodation?</span><span class=\"text-2xl font-normal leading-none text-[#a75536] transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"max-w-2xl pr-10 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500\">Family and group accommodation can be arranged subject to availability. Please contact us with your requirements.</p></details><details class=\"group py-6\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.015em] text-stone-900\"><span>What are the room rates?</span><span class=\"text-2xl font-normal leading-none text-[#a75536] transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"max-w-2xl pr-10 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500\">Nightly rates have not yet been confirmed and are currently available on request.</p></details><details class=\"group py-6\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.015em] text-stone-900\"><span>Can you arrange tours?</span><span class=\"text-2xl font-normal leading-none text-[#a75536] transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"max-w-2xl pr-10 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500\">Tours and activities are enquiry-based. Visit the Experiences page and tell us what interests you.</p></details></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"overflow-hidden bg-forest-950 text-white\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[90rem] px-5 py-14 lg:px-10 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"grid gap-1